<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">Efesi</book>
  <para style="h">Efesi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Efesi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Efesi</para>
  <para style="mt">Efesi</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian duhzâwnga Krista Isua Tirhkoh Paula chuan, mi thianghlim Efesi khuaa awm, Krista Isua mi rinawmte chibai ka bûk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian kan Pa leh Lalpa Isua Krista hnên ata khawngaihna leh remna in hnênah awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kan Lalpa Isua Krista Pa leh Pathian chu i fak ang u. Ani chuan Krista zârah vân hmunahte khian thlarau lam malsâwmna tinrêngin mal min sâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thianghlim leh sawisêlbova a hmaa kan awm theih nân leilung pian hma khân hmangaihnain Kristaah min thlang tawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama duhzâwng leh a tum dân ang taka Isua Krista zâra a fa ni tûrin min lo ruat lâwk tawh bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Duh taka zâra a khawngaihna thil thlâwnpêk ropui tak min pêk avângin i fak ang u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Krista thisena tlan kan ni, kan bawhchhiatnate ngaihdamna chu. A khawngaihna chu a va thûk êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chu khawngaihna chu fing tak leh remhre takin min vûr ta ṭeuh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kristaa a ruat lâwk tawh ang taka tih a tum thurûk chu min hriattîr ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A hun taka Kristaa tihhlawhtlin tûra Pathian thil rêl lâwk chu engkim, vâna thil awm te, leia thil awm te Kristaa fâwk khâwm hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama remruat ang taka thil engkim tihlawhtlingtu duh dân ang ngeiin Krista zârah a mite ni tûrin keini hi min ruat lâwk a, min thlang chhuak tawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Keini Kristaa beiseina nghat hmasate hi a ropuina tilangtu tûr kan ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amahah chuan thutak, in chhandamna Chanchin Ṭha chu, in lo hria a, Krista chu in ring ve ta a; tichuan, Thlarau Thianghlim tiam chuan nangni pawh a chhinchhiah ta che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />In Thlarau dawn kha a ta ni tûra min tlanna avânga kan rochan tûr zakhamna a ni. A ropuina chu fakin awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chuvângin, kei pawhin Lalpa Isua in rinna leh mi thianghlim zawng zawng in hmangaihna ka lo hriatin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />ka ṭawngṭainaahte ka hre reng ṭhîn che u a, nangmahni avângin bâng lovin lâwmthu ka sawi ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kan Lalpa Krista Isua Pathian, ropuina Pa chuan, finna leh hriatthiamna thlarau pe che u rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tichuan, in thinlung mitte tihvârin awm sela, eng beisei tûrin nge a koh che u tih te, mi thianghlimte nêna in rochan tûr a khâwl tamzia te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />keini ringtua a chakna thahrui thiltihtheihna tâwp chin nei lova a thawh nasatzia te in hre thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chu chakna chuan Krista chu mitthi zîng ata a kaitho va, vân hmunahte a ding lamah a ṭhuttîr a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />lalna te, thuneihna te, thiltihtheihna te, rorêlna zawng zawng te chungah, he khawvêl leh khawvêl lo la awm tûra hming sak zawng zawng chung daihah a dah ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />‘A ke hnuaiah chuan engkim a dah ta a, ani chu lu ber atân kohhran hnênah a pe ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kohhran chu Krista taksa a ni, engkim engkima tifamkimtu famkimna chu.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hmânah chuan in bawhchhiatnate leh in sualte avângin thi in ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chutih lai chuan he khawvêl dân ang hian in khawsa a, boruaka thuneitute lal, awih lote chunga tûna thawk mêk thlarau thu thu-a in awm kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />An zîngah chuan keini pawh kan tel vek a, kan tisa châkzâwng ûmin kan tisa duhzâwng leh ngaihtuahzâwng kan ti ṭhîn a, mi dangte ang bawkin Pathian thinurna tuar tûr rênga piang kan nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nimahsela, Pathian khawngaihna chu a nasain, a mi hmangaihna chu a thûk êm a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />kan bawhchhiatnate avânga thi kan nih lai khân Krista nên min tinung ta hlawm a. A khawngaihna avânga chhandam in ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Krista Isuaah chuan min kaithovin, vân hmunahte min ṭhuthotîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Krista Isuaa kan chunga a ngilneihna hian hun lo thleng leh zêl tûr atân pawh khawngaihna a ngah nasatzia a rawn tilang ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Rinna avânga khawngaihnaa chhandam in ni, chu chu in thawh chhuah a ni lo, Pathian thilpêk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thil ṭha tih avângin a ni lo, chuti ni se miin an chhuang dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Krista Isuaah chuan thil ṭha ti tûrin min siam a, a kut chhuak ngei kan nih tâk hi, thil ṭha tih chu kan awm dân tûra Pathian buatsaih lâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nangni hi piannaa Jentail, tisa kuta serhtanten ‘serh tan loh’ an tih ṭhin che u kha;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />khatih lai khân Krista in la nei lo va, Israel chhûngkaw lakah mi hrang in ni a, Pathian thutiamah thuthlung pâwna mi in ni bawk a, khawvêlah hian beiseina rêng nei lo leh Pathian tak hre lova in awm kha hre reng rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tûnah erawh chuan Krista Isuaah, nangni hmâna hla taka awmte kha, Krista thisen chuan tihhnaih in ni ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Krista chu kan inremna a ni. Ani chuan Jentail-te leh keini Juda-te hi pumkhatah min siam a, min daidang ṭhîn intaina bang chu a tisa khân a tibo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Dân thupêkte leh tih tûr awmte chu a titâwp a, keini leh nangni hi amahah chuan mihring thar, pumkhatah min siam a, inremna a rawn thlen ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Krawsah chuan intaina chu a tibo va, Jentail-te leh Juda-te chu pumkhata lo awmin, Pathian nên kan inrem ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A lo kal khân hla taka awm nangni hnênah remna Chanchin Ṭha a hril a, hnai zâwka awm keini hnênah pawh remna Chanchin Ṭha bawk chu a hril a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama zârah Thlarau hmun khatin Pa hnênah kan lût thei ve ve ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tichuan, tûnah hian ram dang mi leh mikhual châm mai in ni tawh lo va, mi thianghlimte nên chuan tualkhat leh Pathian chhûngkua in ni ta zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tirhkohte leh zâwlneite lungphûm chunga rem in ni, chu lungphûma a kil lung pawimawh ber chu Krista Isua hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chu in chu a pumin amahah chuan rem khâwm a ni a, Lalpa tân Tempul thianghlim a lo ni ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nangni pawh amahah chuan mi dangte nên, Thlarauva Pathian chênna in atân rem khâwm in ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hemi avâng hian nangni Jentail-te tâna Krista Isuaa mi tâng, kei Paula hian ka ṭawngṭaisak che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A khawngaihna avângin Pathianin in tân he hna hi thawk tûrin mi ruat tih in hre tawh châwk ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka sawi hlek tawh ang khân Krista thurûk chu inlârnaa hriattîr ka ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka thu ziak in chhiar ngun chuan chu Krista thu ril chu ka hriat chianzia pawh in hre thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A tirhkoh thianghlimte leh zâwlneite hnênah Thlarauvin tûna a hriattîr ang hian, tûn hma chuan he thu ril hi mihringte a la hriattîr ngai lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chanchin Ṭha avângin Krista Isuaah chuan Jentail-te pawh, Israel-te nên ro luah tlâng tûr leh pumkhata awm tûr leh chhûng khat, thutiam dawng ho tûr an nih thu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathian khawngaihna thilpêk mi dawntîr avâng hian, a thiltihtheihna hmangin chu Chanchin Ṭha rawngbâwltua siam chu ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kei hi mi thianghlim zawng zawng zînga tê ber ni mah ila, Jentail-te hnênah Krista hausakna chhui chhuah rual loh chu puang tûrin a khawngaihnain mi ruat a; Pathian engkim siamtu hnêna chatuan ata thuhrûka awm, he a remruat lâwk hi mi zawng zawng hnêna tilang tûra ruat ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathian finna ngahzia hi, kohhran avâng hian, vân hmuna lalte leh thuneitute hnênah tûnah hriattîr a ni ta. Chatuan ata rem a lo ruat tawh ang ngei chu kan Lalpa Isua Kristaah a rawn tihlawhtling ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kristaah chuan, amah kan rin avângin nêl tak leh ngam takin Pathian kan pawh thei ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chutichuan, in tâna ka tuarnate avânga zâm lo tûrin ka ngên a che u, in ropuina tûr a ni e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hemi avâng hian Pa, lei leh vâna chhûngkaw tinrêng hming chawi chhana hmaah chuan
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />ṭhingṭhiin ka kûn ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A thlarau zârah in chhûng lam nun tihchak nân a ropuina nasa tak ata thiltihtheihna pe che u sela,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />rinna avângin Krista chu in thinlungah chêng sela, hmangaihnaah zung kaiin phun ngheh in ni dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tichuan, mi thianghlim zawng zawng nên a hmangaihna zauzia te, seizia te, sânzia te, thûkzia te chiang takin in hre tlâng thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Krista hmangaihna hriat sên rual loh chu in hria ang a, Pathian famkimna tinrênga tihkhah in lo ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chutichuan, keimahnia thawk ṭhîn thiltihtheihna hmanga, kan dîl leh kan ngaihtuah phâk aia nasa zâwka ti theitu hnênah ngei chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />eng lai pawhin Kohhranah leh Krista hnênah ropuina chatuanin awm rawh se. Amen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A kohna che u phua awm tûrin kei, Lalpa avânga tâng hian ka ngên a che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kawng tinrêngah inngaitlâwm leh thuhnuairawlh takin awm ula, inphahhniam takin hmangaihna nên indawh tawn rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Inrem taka awm hovin Thlarauva inpumkhatna hi vawng tlat rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Beisei hmun khat nei tûra koh in ni ang bawkin, taksa pakhat leh Thlarau pakhat chauh a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa pakhat, rinna hmun khat, baptisma hmun khat,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />mi zawng zawng Pa, Pathian pakhat chauh a awm a ni. Ani chu engkim chungah a awm a, engkim a fang chhuak a, engkimah a awm bawk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tichuan, Krista khawngaihna thilthlâwnpêk chu tâwk a tih ang zêlin min pe ṭheuh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lehkha Thu-ah pawh: “Chung lama a chhoh khân Râl a man tâkte tam tak chu salah a hruai a, Mihringte hnênah pawh thilpêk a sem,” tih a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />(Chung lama chho tih hi eng tihna nge? Lei hmun hnuai berah a lo chhuk hmasa tihna a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Engkim a tihfamkim theih nân, lo chhuka ngei kha vân chung daiha han chho leh ta-a chu a ni.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tichuan, mi ṭhenkhat chu tirhkoh atân, ṭhenkhat zâwlnei atân, ṭhenkhat Chanchin Ṭha hriltu atân, ṭhenkhat kohhran enkawltu leh zirtîrtu atân a ruat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chutiang chuan mi thianghlimte tihpuitlin nân rawngbâwl hna thawk tûr leh Krista taksa tiṭhanglian tûrin a ruat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chu chu kan zaa rinna hmun khat kan vawna, Pathian Fapa hriatna kan neiha, mi puitling, Krista famkimna tluka mi famkim kan lo nih theihna tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Fing vervêka thiam taka mi hruai bo an tumna, zirtîrna chi tinrênga lehlam lehlama hruai kawi theih naupangchhia ang kan ni tawh lo vang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />hmangaihnaa thu dik sawiin, engkimah Krista lamah kan ṭhang lian thei ang; Krista chu Lu a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Taksa pum chu amahah a innghat a, tha leh zungin a phuar khâwm a, taksa pêng tin chu an tih tûr ang ti ṭheuhvin an ṭhang tlâng a, hmangaihnain an inchâwm lian ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chutichuan, hei hi ka sawi duh a, Lalpa hmingin ka hrilh a che u; rilru mumal nei lo Jentail-te awm dân angin awm ve tawh suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />An rilru a thim zo va, hriatna an nei lo va, an thinlung an tihchawlawl tawh avângin Pathian nunna lak ata ṭhenin an awm ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Zah nachâng pawh an hre tawh lo va, suahsualnaah an inpumpêk a, duhâm takin thil bawlhhlawh tinrêng an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nangni zawng Krista zirtu in ni a, chutianga awm ve tûr in ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A thu in zawma, thutak, Kristaa awm kha zirtîr in nih takzet chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />tisa châknain a tihkhawloh tawh in awm dân hmasa, mihring hlui kha hlîp rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />In rilru leh thinlung chu tihthar ni sela,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />thutaka chhuak, dikna leh thianghlimnaa Pathian anga siam mihring thar chuan inthuam rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chutichuan, dâwt sawi bânsan ula, Krista taksa pêng kan nih ṭheuh avângin mahni ṭhenawmte chu thu dik chauh hrilh rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Thinrim mah ula, thil sual ti suh u, ni tlâk thleng thlengin thinrim suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Diabola chu hun remchâng pe suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Rûkhmang chuan ru tawh suh se, tlachham hnêna pêk tûr a neih theih nân mahni kut ngeia hna thawkin rim zâwk rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ṭawng mawi lo rêng rêng hmang suh u, mi siam ṭha thei tûr chauh in ka aṭangin chhuak rawh se; chutichuan, a ngaithlatute tân a lâwmawm bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Pathian Thlarau Thianghlim chu tilungngai suh u, tlanna ni atân ama ta ngei in nihzia Pathianin a chhinchhiahna che u a ni e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Huatna te, thinurna te, tauhna te, ânna te, sawichhiatna zawng zawng te nangmahni aṭangin paih bo rawh u, sualna zawng zawng nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Inkhawngaih tawnin inlainat tawn ula, Pathianin Kristaa a ngaidam che u ang hian inngaidam tawn rawh u.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chutichuan, Pathian fa duh takte in nih avângin a awm dân latute ni rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kristan min hmangaiha, Pathian lâwmzâwng thilpêk leh thilhlan rimtui ni tûrin kan tân a inpe ang khân hmangaihna nei ve rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi thianghlimte tih dân tûr ni âwm rêngin inngaihna te, bawlhhlawhna te, duhâmna te in zîngah lam pawh lam ri suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Zahmawh te, ṭawng mawi lo leh fiamthu tenawm sawi te hi in tân a mawi lo va ni, lâwmthu sawi chîng zâwk rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Inngaih chîng te, mi bawlhhlawh te, mi duhâm te (chu chu milem bia tihna a ni) - chûng mite chuan Krista leh Pathian ramah chuan chan tûr rêng an nei lo tih hre rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chûng thil a nêp zâwnga sawitute chuan bum che u suh se, chûng thil avâng chuan Pathian thinurna chu awih lo mite chungah a thleng dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chuvângin, anmahni chu kâwm hlek suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hmânah khân thim in ni a, tûnah erawh chuan Lalpaah êng in lo nih tâk hi, ênga awmte ni âwm rêngin awm rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Êng chu ṭhatna te, felna te leh thutak tinrêngin a rah chhuak ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalpa lâwmzâwng chu eng nge ni tih hriat fiah tum zâwk rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, thima awmte thiltih ṭangkai lovah chuan tel ve hauh suh u, a dik lohzia tilang ṭhîn zâwk rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A rûka an thil tih ṭhinte chu a sawi pawh a zahthlâk si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Eng pawh êngin a chhun chuan a nihna a lang chiang ṭhîn, tihêna awm tawh chu a lo êng ve ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lehkha Thu-ah pawh: “Nang muhîl, harh la, Mitthi zîng ata tho rawh, Krista chuan a chhun êng ang che,” tih a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chutichuan, in khawsak dânah fîmkhur hle rawh u, mi â-te anga awm lovin, mi fingte angin awm zâwk rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hun ṭha lo taka awm kan nih avângin in hun chu hmang ṭha rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chuvângin, â takin awm suh ula, Lalpa duhzâwng eng nge ni tih hriatthiam tum zâwk rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Uain ruih chîng tawh suh u, chhiatna bul a ni e, Thlarauvin khat zâwk rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Fakna hla te, Pathian hla te leh thlarau lam hla te chuan inbe ṭhîn ula, in thinlung takin Lalpa fakna hla sa-in zai rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kan Lalpa Isua Krista hmingin eng lai pawhin engkimah Pa Pathian hnênah lâwmthu hril rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Krista ṭihtute in nih avângin intulût tawn rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nute pawhin Lalpa thu an awih angin mahni pasalte thu an awih tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Krista chu ama taksa, Kohhran chhandamtu a ni a, Kohhran lû a ni ang hian pasal chu nupui lû a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Krista hnênah Kohhran a intulût angin, nupuite pawh engkimah an pasalte hnênah intulût rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Pate u, Kristan kohhran a hmangaih ang hian in nupuite hmangaih ve rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kohhran chu thu leh tuia sil faia tithianghlim tûrin Krista chu amah a inpe a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kohhran ropui tak, zûr lo, kaidum awm lo leh chutiang thil bawlhhlawh kai lo, thianghlim leh hmêlhem lo ama tân din tûrin a inpe a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Pasalte chuan mahni taksa an hmangaih angin mahni nupuite an hmangaih tûr a ni. Mahni nupui hmangaihtu chuan amah a inhmangaih a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tu mân mahni taksa an lungten ngai lo, Kristan kohhran a châwma a duat ang hian an duat zâwk ṭhîn;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />keini pawh a taksa pêngte kan ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Lehkha Thu-ah chuan, “Chumi avâng chuan mipain a nu leh pa a thlah ang a, a nupui a vuan ang; tichuan, an pahnihin tisa pum khat an lo ni tawh ang,” tih a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hei hi thu ril thûk tak a ni, kei chuan Krista leh a kohhran thu a sawina niin ka hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Eng pawh ni se, in zînga tu pawhin mahni a inhmangaih ang bawkin mahni nupui hmangaih ṭheuh rawh se, nupui pawhin a pasal a zah thiam tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Naupangte u, Lalpaah chuan in nu leh in pate thu zâwm rawh u, chu chu thil dik tak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“I nu leh i pa chawimawi rawh,” tih hi thupêk zînga tiam tel nei hmasa ber a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“I tân a ṭha ang a, leiah hian i dam rei bawk ang,” tih a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, nangni pate u, in fate tithinur suh ula, Lalpa zirtîrnaah leh thununnaah enkawl zâwk rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawihte u, Krista thu in zâwm angin rilrua tihtakzetin, hlau leh khûr chungin tisaa in pute thu zâwm rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mihring tihlâwm tumtute ang maia an hmuh lai chauhva thawk lovin, Krista bawih ni âwm rêngin rilru takin Pathian duhzâwng ti ula,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />mihring rawngbâwl mai ni lovin Lalpa rawngbâwl in nih zâwk avângin hlim takin thawk ṭhîn rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawih pawh, bawih lo pawh, mi tinin an thil ṭha tih lâwmman Lalpa hnên ata an hmu ṭheuh dâwn tih in hre si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, nangni hotute u, chutiang bawkin an chungah ti ve rawh u. In bawihte nêna in hotu, thlei bîk nei lo chu, vânah a awm tih hre rengin invau chîng suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A tâwp berah chuan Lalpa leh a chakna aṭang chuan thiltihtheihna la ṭhîn rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Diabola thlêmna in dan theih nân Pathian râlthuam kimin inthuam rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mihring râl do kan ni lo ve, lalna te leh thuneihna te, he khawvêl thim chunga rorêltute leh vân hmuna thlarau sual awmte kan do a nih zâwk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chuvângin, Pathian râlthuam kim chuan inthuam ula, ni ṭha lo a thlen hunah hmêlma in dang tlat thei ang a, in dan zawhah pawh in ding reng thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tichuan, nghet takin ding ula, thutaka in kâwng hrêngin, dikna chu âwmphawah ha rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Remna Chanchin Ṭha puang tûra inpeih rengna chu pheikhawkah bun ula,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />mi sualpa thal alh theite chu in tihmih zêl theih nân rinna hi phawah hmang rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chhandamna chu lukhumah hmang ula; Thlarau khandaih, Pathian thu chu pai rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ṭawngṭai fo ula, Pathian chu in mamawh apiang dîl ula, Thlarau hruai ang zêlin eng hunah pawh ṭawngṭai rawh u. In ṭawngṭainaah chuan mi thianghlim zawng zawng tân bâng lovin dîl rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chanchin Ṭha thu ril huai taka puang tûra thu ka dawn theih nân kei pawh mi dîlsak ula.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chanchin Ṭha palai lung in tâng ka ni a, ka sawi tûr huai taka ka sawi theih nân min dîlsak ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lalpaa unau duh tak leh rawngbâwltu rinawm tak Tukika hian, ka chanchin in hriat theih nân engkim a hrilh ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka chanchin hrilh tûr che u leh thlamuan tûr che uin ani hi ka rawn tîr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pa Pathian leh Lalpa Isua Krista hnên ata remna te, hmangaihna te leh rinna te chu unaute hnênah awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kan Lalpa Isua Krista chuai lova hmangaihtu zawng zawng hnênah khawngaihna awm rawh se.
  </para>
</usx>
